{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17207370","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17207370","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1720737001:0":{"text":"색도 티 하나 없이 깨끗하고, 꽃잎에도 흠 하나 없네요... 이걸로 하죠!","source_cn":"颜色一尘不染，花瓣也没有一点瑕疵……就选这一束吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD650B7FCD5945C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1720737002:1":{"text":"그런데 줄기가 앙상해서 보기 좀 그렇네요... 왕궁의 꽃꽂이 선생님이 그러시는데, 꽃다발은 녹색 잎으로 받쳐주고 적당히 다듬어서 꽃이 더 생기 있어 보이게 한 뒤에, 색감에 맞는 리본도 묶어야 한대요...","source_cn":"可是花束的花杆光秃秃的不太好看……王宫里的花艺老师讲过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65343CBA13C5F167","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720737003:1":{"text":"페기는 자신이 배운 궁정식 꽃꽂이 기술로, 흰 장미를 정성스럽게 조합해 매우 화려하고 완벽한 꽃다발을 만들었다.","source_cn":"佩吉用她学到的宫廷插花术，将采集来的白玫瑰精心搭配成了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DA0022FCA3F96B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:3::2":{"text":"백장미 꽃다발","source_cn":"白玫瑰花束","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9E4E0B7E8995E8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720737004:1":{"text":"봐요! 훨씬 예쁘죠? 이렇게 아름다운 꽃다발이면 분명 기분이 조금은 나아질 거예요.","source_cn":"看！这样就漂亮多了！这么美的花束，一定能让她好受一些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE16FFF9059FA844E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720737005:1":{"text":"어서 드리러 가죠!","source_cn":"走吧，我们这就去送给她！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5DC88439B7830B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:佩吉":{"text":"페기","source":"佩吉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}